NODE id=github.com/paxlabs-inc/tachyon-tools/internal/engine.sourcesProjectID kind=func
  digest=b3:1d47a5ec0e07b81f0e8b54757c425d5730fbc845fffc7dd4bb53e076284cec9b file=tachyon/internal/engine/workdir.go range=49:67 lang=go exported=false byte_range=1728:2374
  sig=func sourcesProjectID(sources map[string]string) string
  doc=sourcesProjectID derives a deterministic project id from the uploaded source\nset, so a compile and a later deploy/call resolve the same registry entries\nwithout the caller threading a path-derived id. Stable across requests with\nidentical content (recompiles are idempotent).
